rustls-ffi (0.15.7-1~smallgearlab1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging of rustls-ffi 0.15.7, the C bindings of Rustls that
    curl's --with-rustls needs, from the upstream release tag.
  * The library package is named after the soname (librustls.so.0.15.7),
    which carries the whole upstream version.
  * Built with the aws-lc-rs provider (HPKE, so Encrypted Client Hello) and
    the cert_compression feature, as a shared library only.
  * No -dbgsym package: the release build carries no debug information.
  * debian/copyright: gen-crate-licenses.py writes a paragraph for each Rust
    crate that is linked in, and debian/librustls*.docs installs the license
    files of those crates.

 -- small-gear-lab <289302950+marie-222@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 17:00:00 +0900
